---
/**
 * Sticky mobile CTA.
 *
 * A floating "Jetzt anfragen" button that slides up from the bottom-right on
 * mobile once the page hero has scrolled out of view. It gives phone visitors a
 * persistent conversion action after the inline hero button — and the many
 * `.hide-mobile-landscape` section CTAs — are gone from the screen.
 *
 * The reveal logic lives in `src/scripts/sticky-cta.js`; it only activates on
 * pages that actually have a `.section_home-header` hero (the homepage and the
 * two marketing landing pages), so the button never shows on the form, contact
 * or legal pages. Styling and breakpoints live in `global.css`.
 */
---

<div class="sticky-cta" data-sticky-cta aria-hidden="true">
  <a href="/anfrage" class="button w-button" tabindex="-1">Jetzt anfragen</a>
</div>
